Subject: [PATCH 25/58] arm64: dts: renesas: r8a774a1: Add RWDT node
Date: Thu, 13 Sep 2018 11:09:20 +0200
Message-Id: <426f0b95af0dfe4f33db6c5ef0a64b1ddcd27053.1536828567.git.horms+renesas@verge.net.au>
